<Section id="what-it-is" num="01" title="What it is">
  <p class="prose">
    mandarinmaxxing is a skill for Claude that teaches Mandarin right in the chat. You choose an HSK 3.0 level and a
    pace, Claude builds you a numbered lesson plan by topic, and then teaches it one lesson at a time.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    Each lesson takes a handful of words that belong together, shows you the phrases they make, has you write your own
    sentences with them, and ends with a short dialogue.
  </p>
</Section>
